  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np27:2.10": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np27:2.11": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np27:2.12": "The six are linen, cotton, silk, wool, sunn hemp, and hemp; see [pli-tv-kd8:3.1.6](). According to [pli-tv-kd8:21.1.4]() this is no smaller than 8 by 4 _sugataṅgula_, “standard fingerbreadths”. For an explanation of the idea of _vikappanā_, see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
